one cause. The @openchamber/sdk 2.7.2 -> 2.8.0 update adds
`dist/navigation.js`. That module defines `guestNavigationCalls`,
`openWalkthrough`, and `GUEST_COMMIT_SHA`. The new `openCommit` uses a spread
of those calls. The remaining lines drop an SDK comment and join SDK call
lines. esbuild stayed at 0.25.12. No file under `panel/` or `src/` changed.

The extension still declares `openchamber >=2.7.1` in its `engines` field.
The bundle now builds against @openchamber/sdk 2.8.0. This track did not
change the declared floor. The PM can decide whether to raise it.

